  "aiContextParagraph": "At the 33rd APEC summit in Shenzhen, China, President Prabowo Subianto engaged in high-level diplomatic activities, including a significant private meeting with Russian President Vladimir Putin. Government officials confirmed that the hour-long session focused on bilateral economic relations and broader global stability concerns. Beyond individual bilateral engagements, the summit featured discussions on critical international agendas, such as digital economy integration, food security, and energy diplomacy. President Prabowo also addressed the role of artificial intelligence, advocating for technological advancements that do not exacerbate existing wealth inequalities between nations. The event also included broader dialogue among global leaders, including Xi Jinping and Donald Trump, regarding future geopolitical frameworks. Meanwhile, the NATO Secretary-General addressed international observers by dismissing concerns about a potential return to exclusionary power-sharing agreements following high-level meetings between major world leaders.",
